OL,3,GNEWSALara Croft statue set to return to
OL,4,ADerby
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 9ft (2.7m) statue of Tomb Raider hero
OL,7,FLara Croft is due to arrive at a
OL,8,Ftemporary site in her home city of
OL,9,FDerby ahead of its permanent
OL,10,Finstallation.
OL,12,FThe sculpture formed part of the Tomb
OL,13,FRaider: The LIVE Experience in Camden
OL,14,FMarket in London but has been in
OL,15,Fstorage since the attraction closed in
OL,16,F2023.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
