OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSALara Croft statue set to return to
OL,4,ADerby
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing a #30,000 fundraising appeal
OL,7,Fto bring the statue to Derby and create
OL,8,Fa permanent landmark celebrating the
OL,9,Fcity's role in video game folklore, the
OL,10,Ffibreglass effigy will go on display at
OL,11,Fthe Museum of Making from Wednesday for
OL,12,F"a number of weeks" before moving to
OL,13,Fits "forever home" at the Market Hall.
OL,15,FIts arrival comes ahead of the city's
OL,16,Fsixth Tomb Raider Day on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
